105537.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z"},"body":"If you for example create a `BoneAttachment3D` and query `\"albasldasbla\" in bone_attachment` it would always return true.\r\nThis is because its `_get` always reported that a property exists.\r\n\r\nI went through all classes that override `_get` and fixed this problem everywhere I could find.\r\nThe same still has to be done for `_set` in the future (I only updated those `_set`'s on classes that had erroneous `_get`'s)!\r\n\r\nIdeally, this could be automatically detected and reported in debug builds, by checking whether the second parameter was modified when true is returned. But that is outside of the scope of this PR.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105537/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105537/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}